# Backtest / fold run output. NOTE: this ignores the WHOLE directory, including
# future *.md and *.json validation deliverables — and the backtest methodology in
# CLAUDE.md requires those be committed with their table and selection rule. The 27
# result files tracked before this rule was added stay tracked (gitignore does not
# untrack), so only NEW result files become invisible. If the intent was only to
# drop the noisy run logs, narrow this to: docs/superpowers/results/*.log
docs/superpowers/results/
